  "open_work": [
    "Two immutable source records retain their plan envelopes and original upper datums. Four register feet and four display posts fill the former .01m gap onto the actual fitted 1.12m serving sheet. Original hidden source poses remain unchanged.",
    "The passive mechanical register faces the existing clerk side of the counter. Joined case panels, sloped key bed, unlettered Bakelite keys, closed cash-drawer face and blank mechanical indicator slots replace the solid plated box. No illumination, payment, till operation, inventory, new programme or service authority.",
    "The display replaces its solid glass block with closed 4mm panes inside the original envelope, a joined timber/brass frame and genuinely empty chamber. Original shipping tint/maps/culling remain; bounded local plain-alpha blending follows the existing display-case optical adaptation. No invented tobacco stock, opening, locks or purchasing.",
    "Accepted native counter/ledger, eight stools and two receivers keep their exact meshes and nonvisual authority. Physical support/clearance and sampled observations grant no continuous route, utility capacity or human acceptance."
  ]
